<item><title>佛山禅城一日游</title><link>https://fifteenbao.com/post/20261018%E4%BD%9B%E5%B1%B1%E7%A6%85%E5%9F%8E%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E6%B8%B8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fifteenbao.com/post/20261018%E4%BD%9B%E5%B1%B1%E7%A6%85%E5%9F%8E%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E6%B8%B8/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:00:00 &#43;0800</pubDate><description>今日重阳节，报了个艺旅的团来佛山 city walk。很奇妙的城市。历史大熔炉。</description></item><item><title>伏见清酒之旅</title><link>https://fifteenbao.com/post/20260708%E4%BC%8F%E8%A7%81%E6%B8%85%E9%85%92%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%85/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fifteenbao.com/post/20260708%E4%BC%8F%E8%A7%81%E6%B8%85%E9%85%92%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%85/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 08 Jul 2026 00:00:00 &#43;0800</pubDate><description>上个月去了关西玩了十天，报了一个一天的伏见清酒之旅的团，遇到了好多有意思的人。</description></item><item><title>湾厦两日游</title><link>https://fifteenbao.com/post/20260329%E6%B9%BE%E5%8E%A6%E4%B8%A4%E6%97%A5%E6%B8%B8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fifteenbao.com/post/20260329%E6%B9%BE%E5%8E%A6%E4%B8%A4%E6%97%A5%E6%B8%B8/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 29 Mar 2026 00:00:00 &#43;0800</pubDate><description>周日在湾厦参加了一个 《繁华与利剑》 策展人 陈嘉雯的讲座，说来搞笑，今天的展览，日历上记错了时间，昨天就来了……误打误撞听到了蛇口无车日 策展人吴文媛老师的演讲…… 有点意外之喜了。</description></item><item><title>大沙河公园游记</title><link>https://fifteenbao.com/post/20260316%E5%A4%A7%E6%B2%99%E6%B2%B3%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD%E6%B8%B8%E8%AE%B0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fifteenbao.com/post/20260316%E5%A4%A7%E6%B2%99%E6%B2%B3%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD%E6%B8%B8%E8%AE%B0/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Mar 2026 00:00:00 &#43;0800</pubDate><description>“周末参加了一个植物标本制作的活动，之前 jerry老师 带着我们逛了一圈在垃圾填埋场上改造的大沙河公园”</description></item></channel></rss>
